5,1,1,talk,George,,We need a system that doesn't ruin our friendship. I'll look into what other households said and the spell of checking figures.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to know where the time goes. I'll check the hours of use in the diary and the month's trial of recording runs.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I care about the daily reality. I'll check the state of the car at handover and the trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I want to see the actual costs. I'll look at last year's tax, insurance and parking papers and the fuel receipts.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know who drives the most. I'll check the weeks of heavy use and the mechanic's remarks.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
