25,2,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
26,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
27,2,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
28,2,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
29,2,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,George,,It seems checking each other's figures creates tension. Other groups say asking for favors constantly is what sours the mood.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Recording every run is a time sink, and the usage is wildly uneven between weekdays and weekends.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The car is often left dirty or empty, and our weekly commitments are the things that usually clash.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen, but the fuel spending is very lopsided. Some of us pay much more.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Heavy use comes in bursts, and the mechanic says our short city trips are wearing the car down faster.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, if the fuel is lopsided, that's exactly the kind of thing that leads to the resentment I read about.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, if weekly trips are collapsing, a fixed schedule might be better than a flexible one.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, I agree. The current ""ask and hope"" method isn't working for my morning routine.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, the bursts of use you found explain why the fuel receipts are so uneven.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Minato,,It feels like we are all guessing. I just want it to be fair for everyone.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,George,,We should avoid any system that requires us to police each other's spending too closely.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Toshio,,A system that removes the need for constant negotiation would save us all a lot of stress.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I just want to know the car will be there and ready when I need it for my weekly trips.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"An even split is a nice idea, but the data shows we don't actually use it evenly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Minato,,Maybe we can find a way to pay that doesn't make people feel accused?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,George,,Let's look at the options and pick the one that minimizes friction.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Efficiency and peace of mind are the priorities.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Victoria,,As long as it guarantees availability.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Misaki,,And addresses the financial imbalance.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we can all agree.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,3,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
51,3,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
