54,3,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
55,3,1,talk,George,,Option A is a booking calendar with distance-based costs. B is fixed days and fixed costs. C is a primary keeper.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B removes the negotiation and the time spent arranging. It's the most efficient for my schedule.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Victoria,,B would solve my problem with the weekly trips. I'd know exactly when the car is mine.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"A is the most fair financially, but George warned us that checking figures causes fights.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A seems the most honest about who uses the car, but I don't want anyone to be sad.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,George,,"I vote for B. It stops the ""asking for favors"" cycle that ruins these arrangements.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I also vote for B. It eliminates the administrative burden of recording every single run.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Victoria,,I'm voting for B. Predictability is more important to me than perfect financial precision.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"If A leads to the ""checking figures"" conflict George mentioned, then B is a safer social choice.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, do you think B is fair enough?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,George,,"It's fair in terms of access, which is where the real tension lies.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It's a compromise. We trade perfect accounting for peace.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Victoria,,It's the only way to ensure the car is actually there on a Tuesday morning.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll vote for B. It's better to have a simple rule than a perfect one that makes us fight.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Minato,,"I'll go with B too, if everyone else likes it. I want us to stay friends.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
